<title>JAPAN: Hakusui Chemical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hakusui Chemical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  5.63		vs	    5.93</p>
<p> Operating	  289    million    vs	  353    million</p>
<p> Current	     96    million    vs	  236    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 612    million    vs	prft 225 million</p>
<p> EPS	   loss 148.06 yen	  vs    prft 54.39 yen</p>
<p> Shares		4 million	  vs	   4 million</p>
<p> Interim div		--	    vs		 --</p>
<p>NOTE - Hakusui Chemical Industries Ltd is a leading manufacturer of zinc oxide, zinc dust and other ceramic materials.</p>
